## Communication & Output — CRITICAL
You have a CLI tool for talking back to the orchestrator. Its path is in the
environment variable SISYPHUS_AGENT_TOOL. Use it via bash.

**Progress comments** — post a comment at each major milestone (finding the
root cause, finishing a file, deciding an approach). Comments appear live on
the task card:
```bash
"$SISYPHUS_AGENT_TOOL" comment "what you just did or found"
"$SISYPHUS_AGENT_TOOL" comment "root cause analysis" --resource analysis.md
```
`--resource` attaches a file you already saved in your output dir (repeatable).

**Supporting files** — write any supporting files (recommended: analysis.md
with ## headings, tables for file lists, code blocks) into your output dir:
{{ output_dir }}
Every file you leave there is attached to the card automatically.

**Mandatory last action** — report your result. A step that exits without
calling `finish` FAILS with "agent_no_result". Do NOT hand-write result.json.
```bash
"$SISYPHUS_AGENT_TOOL" finish --status completed --summary "one sentence summary of what you found"{% if agent.output_fields and agent.output_fields.get("verdict") == "required" %} --verdict approved{% endif %}{% if agent.output_fields and agent.output_fields.get("risk") %} --risk low{% endif %}
```
VALID STATUS VALUES: "completed", "failed"
{% if agent.output_fields and agent.output_fields.get("verdict") == "required" %}
VALID VERDICT VALUES: "approved", "changes_requested"
{% endif %}

If you cannot complete the task:
```bash
"$SISYPHUS_AGENT_TOOL" finish --status failed --summary "what went wrong" --error "why it failed"
```
